#NEXUS

[ wang2025a_fig3: Time-calibrated sauropodomorph tree, thin lines, coloured range bars, 69 tips; several polytomies (a 6-way basal node, a 7-way node with Jaklapallisaurus to Nambalia, a 7-way node in Sauropodiformes, a 3-way Gongxianosaurus/Ingentia node). Matrix spellings: PVL_3808 (printed Riojasaurus PVL3808), NMQR3314 and NMQR1551 (printed Melanorosaurus NMQR...), Meroktenus (printed Meroktenos), Neosauropoda (printed NEOSAUROPODA, a matrix row). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node (2026-10-29); topology only. ]

